807
00:37:10,731 --> 00:37:12,431
I can smell something good.

808
00:37:13,101 --> 00:37:16,231
The smell of meat. I'm hungry.

809
00:37:16,801 --> 00:37:19,841
My guess is that they cook in there and bring out the food.

810
00:37:20,201 --> 00:37:21,341
Extraordinary Couple.

811
00:37:22,211 --> 00:37:24,311
Everything About Tteokbokki. Number One.

812
00:37:24,871 --> 00:37:25,941
Here they are.

813
00:37:26,781 --> 00:37:28,611
They are as old as my mom.

814
00:37:29,211 --> 00:37:31,581
One minute?

815
00:37:32,421 --> 00:37:33,880
Okay, we can serve it now.

816
00:37:33,881 --> 00:37:35,651
All of them are set.

817
00:37:37,051 --> 00:37:38,321
I can smell meat.

818
00:37:39,821 --> 00:37:43,560
