820
00:37:44,991 --> 00:37:48,331
My stomach is growling hard because of the smell of food.

821
00:37:49,501 --> 00:37:52,241
Perilla seed cream sauce. Made with rice from Cheorwon.

822
00:37:53,441 --> 00:37:58,011
(Menu with the names and descriptions of the dishes)

823
00:37:58,271 --> 00:38:01,841
Try to evaluate which dish was the best.

824
00:38:03,211 --> 00:38:07,421
Teams, please serve the dish to each table.

825
00:38:10,451 --> 00:38:12,761
- Hi.
- Hi.

826
00:38:14,161 --> 00:38:15,430
Thank you.

827
00:38:15,431 --> 00:38:16,660
- Rice dough ball...
- Yes?

828
00:38:16,661 --> 00:38:18,130
Made with rice from Cheorwon, Gangwon Province.

829
00:38:18,131 --> 00:38:19,571
It's a perilla seed rice dough ball.

830
00:38:19,731 --> 00:38:20,731
- Thank you.
- Perilla rice dough ball cream.

831
00:38:20,731 --> 00:38:21,731
Enjoy.

832
00:38:21,732 --> 00:38:23,030
- It looks good.
- These are fatsia shoots...

833
00:38:23,031 --> 00:38:24,300
and squash.

834
00:38:24,301 --> 00:38:25,670
- Eat them while they're crispy.
- Okay.

835
00:38:25,671 --> 00:38:26,671
- Okay.
- Thank you.

836
00:38:26,672 --> 00:38:29,110
- Hi.
- Hi.

837
00:38:29,111 --> 00:38:31,470
We prepared seven side dishes...

838
00:38:31,471 --> 00:38:33,541
you can enjoy with rice.

839
00:38:33,741 --> 00:38:35,980
Here are tomato kimchi,

840
00:38:35,981 --> 00:38:38,581
stir-fried perilla seed mushroom namul,

841
00:38:38,751 --> 00:38:41,380
and salad with cheonhyehyang and webfoot octopus.

842
00:38:41,381 --> 00:38:43,220
Crown daisy and pear are at the bottom.

843
00:38:43,221 --> 00:38:44,621
Have them together.

844
00:38:44,851 --> 00:38:47,091
Tofu was grilled in perilla oil.

845
00:38:47,191 --> 00:38:48,220
You can have it...

846
00:38:48,221 --> 00:38:49,460
- with fatsia shoots.
- Enjoy.

847
00:38:49,461 --> 00:38:50,461
Rice dough balls. I'm from...

848
00:38:50,462 --> 00:38:51,607
- Gangwon Province.
- Have them together, okay?

849
00:38:51,631 --> 00:38:52,860
- Perilla seed cream.
- Enjoy.

850
00:38:52,861 --> 00:38:54,901
You know it's Gangwon Province's famous ingredient.

851
00:38:55,571 --> 00:38:57,100
I'm also from Gangwon Province.

852
00:38:57,101 --> 00:38:58,601
- Enjoy.
- We will.

853
00:38:59,641 --> 00:39:01,271
- Hi, ma'am.
- Hi.

854
00:39:01,601 --> 00:39:03,211
Let me serve you our dish.

855
00:39:03,511 --> 00:39:05,710
The dish we prepared today is what's called...

856
00:39:05,711 --> 00:39:07,911
jeongabok.

857
00:39:09,451 --> 00:39:12,420
The real dish that wishes for health and prosperity.

858
00:39:12,421 --> 00:39:14,541
(A masterpiece with the delicacies from land and sea)

859
00:39:14,821 --> 00:39:17,091
There's a saying that you'll get rich if you eat this.

860
00:39:17,351 --> 00:39:18,960
- Please try it and become rich.
- Okay.

861
00:39:18,961 --> 00:39:20,520
- Got it.
- Thank you.

862
00:39:20,521 --> 00:39:22,160
- Thank you.
- The food is good.

863
00:39:22,161 --> 00:39:23,490
- I'm glad.
- It's good.

864
00:39:23,491 --> 00:39:25,260
- Please remember jeongabok.
- Jeongabok.

865
00:39:25,261 --> 00:39:27,231
You don't have to remember the others.

866
00:39:28,361 --> 00:39:31,300
We made a delicious risotto...

867
00:39:31,301 --> 00:39:32,840
out of Cheorwon Odae Rice.

868
00:39:32,841 --> 00:39:34,540
On top is tteokgalbi made with...

869
00:39:34,541 --> 00:39:37,241
Korean beef and Korean pork cooked over charcoal.

870
00:39:37,641 --> 00:39:38,740
- What is it?
- Is it risotto?

871
00:39:38,741 --> 00:39:41,740
Yes, we made it less thick, like porridge.

872
00:39:41,741 --> 00:39:43,851
The hand warmer is to keep the dish warm for you.

873
00:39:44,211 --> 00:39:46,681
What was always disappointing was that...

874
00:39:46,881 --> 00:39:49,820
we were unable to serve the hot dishes warm.

875
00:39:49,821 --> 00:39:52,021
So we used up...

876
00:39:52,191 --> 00:39:54,091
all the hand warmers we had.

877
00:39:55,091 --> 00:39:58,831
The broth is based on dried seaweed and doenjang.

878
00:40:00,761 --> 00:40:03,030
- Hi.
- What is that?

879
00:40:03,031 --> 00:40:04,871
We're serving French cuisine.

880
00:40:05,371 --> 00:40:07,471
Odae Rice was toasted raw...

881
00:40:07,771 --> 00:40:09,641
to make it light and fluffy.

882
00:40:10,371 --> 00:40:12,911
The sauce was made with doenjang.

883
00:40:13,111 --> 00:40:15,211
It's best when you mix it with rice.

884
00:40:15,551 --> 00:40:16,711
- Enjoy.
- Thank you.

885
00:40:17,451 --> 00:40:18,750
- Excuse me.
- Go ahead.

886
00:40:18,751 --> 00:40:21,580
Here's risotto made with fresh spring vegetables and wild greens,

887
00:40:21,581 --> 00:40:23,251
served with four kinds of seafood.

888
00:40:24,391 --> 00:40:26,060
Excuse me, ma'am.

889
00:40:26,061 --> 00:40:29,161
This is Sichuan-style yuxiang sauce.

890
00:40:29,361 --> 00:40:30,991
The dish is yuxiang shiitake mushrooms,

891
00:40:31,331 --> 00:40:32,600
featuring fresh shiitake mushrooms...

892
00:40:32,601 --> 00:40:35,261
stuffed with minced burdock root and shrimp.

893
00:40:35,831 --> 00:40:37,601
Enjoy it with rice while it's warm.

894
00:40:38,071 --> 00:40:39,540
It's stuffed with ingredients.

895
00:40:39,541 --> 00:40:41,470
(Shin Ga Young, Lim Ki Hak, Kim Hee Eun, Jo Seo Hyung, )

896
00:40:41,471 --> 00:40:43,791
(Kim Kwan Hoon, Kim Ho Yoon, Kwak Dong Hoon, Lee Jae Hoon)

897
00:40:44,211 --> 00:40:48,741
(The chefs can watch it live from the monitor room.)

898
00:40:48,951 --> 00:40:50,750
Customers around that age...

899
00:40:50,751 --> 00:40:52,951
would have a traditional palate.

900
00:40:53,651 --> 00:40:57,051
I wonder how they think about our dish.

901
00:40:57,151 --> 00:40:59,261
I'm sure at least half of the dishes...

902
00:40:59,661 --> 00:41:02,330
are new to them.

903
00:41:02,331 --> 00:41:03,361
Right?

904
00:41:03,631 --> 00:41:06,461
Old ladies are accurate when it comes to evaluating.

905
00:41:07,501 --> 00:41:11,770
(What did the old ladies think about the dishes?)

906
00:41:11,771 --> 00:41:14,171
- It's made with Odae Rice.
- Correct.

907
00:41:14,801 --> 00:41:17,011
Everything was cooked with Odae Rice.

908
00:41:18,211 --> 00:41:19,640
Let's try the rice dough ball.

909
00:41:19,641 --> 00:41:22,357
(Perilla seed cream rice dough ball from Everything About Tteokbokki)

910
00:41:22,381 --> 00:41:23,451
It's mine.

911
00:41:29,151 --> 00:41:30,351
It's really good.

912
00:41:31,351 --> 00:41:32,390
It really is.

913
00:41:32,391 --> 00:41:33,791
- Which one?
- The rice dough ball.

914
00:41:36,791 --> 00:41:37,931
The sauce.

915
00:41:42,571 --> 00:41:43,701
I'm thinking...

916
00:41:44,701 --> 00:41:47,400
