917
00:41:47,401 --> 00:41:48,571
I can feel the rice grains.

918
00:41:49,011 --> 00:41:51,111
Use your tongue. You can feel the rice grains.

919
00:41:51,811 --> 00:41:53,180
It's made with Odae Rice.

920
00:41:53,181 --> 00:41:55,111
- You can feel the rice, right?
- Yes.

921
00:41:55,681 --> 00:41:57,151
It's a dish made with rice.

922
00:41:57,211 --> 00:42:00,120
I was hoping the customers would focus on...

923
00:42:00,121 --> 00:42:02,421
